  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TCPF: Strengthening capacity of fisheries resource owners (Topwi) in the Manus Province for CBFM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide technical advice and support to selected customary marine tenure groups in Manus to develop sustainable food systems based on strengthened indigenous institutions which are formally recognized, and to prepare these communities to trial and implement CBFM to strengthen local food systems.</narrative>
  </description>
